 forward

[ Upstream commit 9dad4d964291295ef48243d4e03972b85138bc9f ]

1. do roll forward recovery
2. update current segments pointers
3. fix the entire zones' write pointers
4. do checkpoint

Reviewed-by: Daeho Jeong <daehojeong@google.com>
