WARNING: CPU: 0 PID: 965 at drivers/net/phy/phy_device.c:326 mdio_bus_phy_resume+0x140/0x144
CPU: 0 PID: 965 Comm: sh Tainted: G           O       6.1.46-g247b2535b2 #1
