 		if (buffer) {
 			/* Check if we can use field ea->name */
 			if (off + ea_size > size)

From 4e5bd2287021823c10862379312648dd55e17f49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johannes Berg <johannes.berg@intel.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jan 2024 15:53:55 +0100
