 of redefining it

[ Upstream commit b3ff2d9c3a9c64cd0a011cdd407ffc38a6ea8788 ]

ARCH_ENABLE_THP_MIGRATION is supposed to be selected by arch Kconfig.

Signed-off-by: Masahiro Yamada <masahiroy@kernel.org>
