[ Upstream commit 4c892121d43bc2b45896ca207b54f39a8fa6b852 ]

The PHY is configured in 10GBASE-R, so make sure to reflect that in DT.

Reviewed-by: Jon Hunter <jonathanh@nvidia.com>
