Fixes: 19a38d8e0aa3 ("USB2NET : SR9800 : One chip USB2.0 USB2NET SR9800 Device Driver Support")
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20240305075927.261284-1-nichen@iscas.ac.cn
