Fixes: 0bf5eb788512 ("net: hns3: add support for PTP")
Signed-off-by: Yonglong Liu <liuyonglong@huawei.com>
Signed-off-by: Jijie Shao <shaojijie@huawei.com>
Signed-off-by: David S. Miller <davem@davemloft.net>
