From 48cc1eb96aebf36e23bd73f039c15a6af40c0fbb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Huibin Hong <huibin.hong@rock-chips.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Jul 2024 19:51:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2079/2766] ARM: configs: rk3506: enable some debug functions

Sysrq,hardlock,softlock,hangtask, rockchip debug and so on.

