From 8826fbcc1d10f0359c6fa7d721f64c79f6b74b23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chen Shunqing <csq@rock-chips.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Jul 2024 10:01:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2266/2766] media: i2c: rk628: fix no display because clear
 avmute is not received

