 defconfig

Separate modules:
1. rk3506-display.config
2. rk3506-ethernet.config
3. rk3506-wifibt.config
4. rk3506-usb-host.config
5. rk3506-usb-peripheral.config
6. rk3506-usb-otg.config

Keep 'm' value to these modules in rk3506_defconfig.

