Subject: [PATCH 2642/2766] ARM: dts: rockchip: rk3502: support uart frac 96M
 and 128M

Change-Id: Ifb9c17ee28f4e822836f7aeaa354e3cbd3454e85
Signed-off-by: Huibin Hong <huibin.hong@rock-chips.com>
