From 75b1b3b5f04ffce34d5317943c76242bb924c326 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Feng Zhang <feng@radxa.com>
Date: Fri, 22 Mar 2024 11:30:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2698/2766] arm64: dts: rock 5c: fix level of user-led2

Signed-off-by: Feng Zhang <feng@radxa.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-rock-5c.dts | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

