From 7083d80caf70a8c684671f83d140a465d7a35c37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RadxaMitchell <machuang@radxa.com>
Date: Wed, 29 May 2024 19:49:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2721/2766] net: wireless: rockchip_wlan: modify firmware path
 to /lib/firmware/brcm

Signed-off-by: RadxaMitchell <machuang@radxa.com>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/rockchip_wlan/rkwifi/Kconfig      |  4 ++--
 .../net/wireless/rockchip_wlan/rkwifi/bcmdhd/Kconfig   |  4 ++--
 .../net/wireless/rockchip_wlan/rkwifi/bcmdhd/Makefile  | 10 +++++-----
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/rockchip_wlan/rkwifi/Kconfig b/drivers/net/wireless/rockchip_wlan/rkwifi/Kconfig
index 3659e604e9209..0054b7e86e708 100644
