From 83cf20928c98e1bf9d9535f7a856b7bb39feccb5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ken Wang <ken@radxa.com>
Date: Mon, 11 Nov 2024 10:45:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2749/2766] arm64: dts: rockchip: modify fan pwm period to 60us

Reduce pwm frequency to 16.6 KHz for a larger adjustable range of AO3416 mosfet.

Signed-off-by: Ken Wang <ken@radxa.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-rock-5b-plus.dts  | 2 +-
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-rock-5b.dts       | 2 +-
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588-rock-5t.dts       | 2 +-
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-radxa-cm5-io.dts | 2 +-
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-radxa-e52c.dts   | 2 +-
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-radxa-nx5-io.dts | 2 +-
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-rock-5a.dts      | 2 +-
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-rock-5c.dts      | 2 +-
