From dc42d6035b38c2b199079a73f4595ddbca952d05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ken Wang <ken@radxa.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Jun 2024 17:02:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2751/2766] rockchip_linux_defconfig: built-in CONFIG_FB

